RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2024437 - Restore `mFirstLegend` on failure. a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D288843\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D289769\n", "files": ["dom/html/HTMLFieldSetElement.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLFieldSetElement.h"], "git_node": "d536198ef3b111d1a30b0f1e367cbe63062904d9", "git_parents": ["8c6c39778b69d167d31d58a0c0cd28e57d6888f9"], "node": "97567dae3e3cf2dc5486ec37aeaccf550bbedd9e", "parents": ["9931574e5a2ad9424f26b25ebaa5e83c354721ed"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Simon Farre \u003csimon.farre.cx@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_34_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2024433 - Notify of attribute change in BlastSubtree a=pascalc\n\nBlastSubtreeToPieces is called during error recovery. It makes sense to\nnotify of attribute changes.\n\nThis effectively means extra work during error recovery, but the\nreasoning is that this should happen (very) rarely and when it does,\nit's fine to do the \"extra\" work.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D289225\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D290513\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp"], "git_node": "1580b94a15cc5758b447bf34117eca10be1bf96e", "git_parents": ["d536198ef3b111d1a30b0f1e367cbe63062904d9"], "node": "3d6ce8f7a8a7770d096680c7881f8eae9252aef3", "parents": ["97567dae3e3cf2dc5486ec37aeaccf550bbedd9e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Henri Sivonen \u003chsivonen@hsivonen.fi\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_34_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2024417. a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D289170\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D290035\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsGlobalWindowInner.cpp", "dom/base/nsGlobalWindowInner.h", "dom/base/nsPIDOMWindow.h", "dom/clients/manager/ClientSource.cpp"], "git_node": "2c9b71e6d8db7a8abaf07deaa47f2db845fbef63", "git_parents": ["1580b94a15cc5758b447bf34117eca10be1bf96e"], "node": "