Farre \u003csimon.farre.cx@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2024433 - Notify of attribute change in BlastSubtree  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nBlastSubtreeToPieces is called during error recovery. It makes sense to\nnotify of attribute changes.\n\nThis effectively means extra work during error recovery, but the\nreasoning is that this should happen (very) rarely and when it does,\nit's fine to do the \"extra\" work.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D289225\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D290513\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp"], "git_node": "4a997d8960c5b1b4d6afebc8c81bad0255bd4e38", "git_parents": ["c35b63be469e8eafc24efd16d882c1524fa78107"], "node": "929c73d6dcb545386f5db29c1da08ecd2bd2a485", "parents": ["b26e86169b74d55ae4b8c529b9c279b51fd359d0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1775071691, "git_changesets": ["4a997d8960c5b1b4d6afebc8c81bad0255bd4e38"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "999": {"changesets": [{"author": "Tom Schuster \u003ctschuster@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2025381 - Handle AbortSignal's reason more consistently.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D289576\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D290409\n", "files": ["dom/abort/AbortSignal.cpp", "dom/fetch/Fetch.cpp"], "git_node": "5f7e76969a8e697c5105035c7c4e4b1a25e0d641", "git_parents": ["4a997d8960c5b1b4d6afebc8c81bad0255bd4e38"], "node": "1c438b5ca33f2711112e1fd68b2fc81963178283", "parents": ["929c73d6dcb545386f5db29c1da08ecd2bd2a485"], "tags": []}], "date": 1775072572, "git_changesets": ["5f7e76969a8e697c5105035c7c4e4b1a25e0d641"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}}
